  "description": "<h3 data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"113\">&bull; Brand Introduction:</h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"420\" data-start=\"141\"><strong data-end=\"153\" data-start=\"141\">WithLove</strong> is a modern children&rsquo;s nutrition company on a mission to bring more harmony into the home. Founded by two dads who struggled to find healthy solutions for their picky eaters, WithLove makes clean, functional nutrition that parents can trust&mdash;and kids actually love.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"425\" data-start=\"422\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"427\">&bull; Product Description:</h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"743\" data-start=\"456\">Our flagship product is a <strong data-end=\"536\" data-start=\"482\">3-in-1 Protein, Probiotic, and Multivitamin Powder</strong>, formulated specifically for kids ages 2&ndash;13. With just <strong data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"592\">8 real, whole food ingredients</strong>, it&rsquo;s an easy way to fill nutritional gaps&mdash;perfect for smoothies, baked goods, or even mixed into oatmeal or yogurt.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"745\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"785\" data-start=\"750\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"786\">\r\n<li data-end=\"889\" data-start=\"786\">\r\n<p data-end=\"889\" data-start=\"788\"><strong data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"788\">All-in-One Simplicity</strong>: Combines protein, probiotics, and multivitamins in a single daily scoop.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"995\" data-start=\"890\">\r\n<p data-end=\"995\" data-start=\"892\"><strong data-end=\"916\" data-start=\"892\">Picky-Eater Approved</strong>: Delicious taste kids love (even without added sugar or artificial flavors).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"996\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"998\"><strong data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"998\">Parent Peace of Mind</strong>: Clean-label formula, pediatrician-reviewed, no synthetic junk.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1089\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1091\"><strong data-end=\"1111\" data-start=\"1091\">Real Ingredients</strong>: Only 8 whole food-based ingredients you can actually pronounce.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1180\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1207\" data-start=\"1185\">&bull; Payment Terms:</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1436\" data-start=\"1208\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1254\" data-start=\"1208\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1254\" data-start=\"1210\"><strong data-end=\"1224\" data-start=\"1210\">Commission</strong>: 30% on every New Customer sale (10% Recurring FOR LIFE)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1287\" data-start=\"1255\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1287\" data-start=\"1257\"><strong data-end=\"1276\" data-start=\"1257\">Cookie Duration</strong>: 30 days</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1349\" data-start=\"1288\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1349\" data-start=\"1290\"><strong data-end=\"1310\" data-start=\"1290\">Payout Frequency</strong>: Monthly via PayPal or bank transfer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1436\" data-start=\"1350\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1436\" data-start=\"1352\"><strong data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1352\">Bonuses</strong>: Exclusive performance bonuses for top affiliates and content creators (Up To 40% Commissions)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1438\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1469\" data-start=\"1443\">&bull; Other Information:</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1837\" data-start=\"1470\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1569\" data-start=\"1470\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1569\" data-start=\"1472\">You&rsquo;ll get a unique affiliate link (with coupon code) and a full media kit with images, copy, and creative assets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1639\" data-start=\"1570\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1639\" data-start=\"1572\">Our average order value is $120+, with high repeat customer rates (40%)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1755\" data-start=\"1640\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1755\" data-start=\"1642\">Top content angles: picky eater solutions, mom hacks, wellness routines, family nutrition, back-to-school prep, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1837\" data-start=\"1756\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1837\" data-start=\"1758\">We love collaborating with creators who are authentic, fun, and family-focused.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
