  "term_and_condition": "<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:24pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">WithLove Affiliate Program Terms &amp; Conditions</span></b></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">Thank you for your interest in becoming a WithLove affiliate partner. We value the role you play in sharing our message of bringing harmony to homes and promoting healthy, nutritious solutions for kids. To ensure a successful partnership and maintain the integrity of our brand, we have outlined the following terms and conditions.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">By participating in the WithLove Affiliate Program, you agree to comply with the following:</span></p>\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><hr align=\"left\" noshade width=\"100%\" size=\"0\" style=\"color:#414141;\"></div>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">1. Prohibited Activities</span></b></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">To maintain ethical marketing practices and protect the WithLove brand, affiliates are strictly prohibited from the following activities:</span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;\">a) Branded Search Advertising</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"