d Unauthorized Email Marketing</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Affiliates may not engage in spam email marketing. All email marketing efforts must comply with <b>CAN-SPAM Act</b> guidelines.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Emails must clearly disclose your affiliate relationship with WithLove.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;\">g) Coupon and Discount Abuse</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Affiliates may not promote unauthorized or expired coupons.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Do not use coupon websites solely to drive traffic for affiliate commissions.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;\">h) Social Media Misuse</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt