t;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">2. Commission Structure</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Affiliates will earn a commission for each verified sale generated through their unique affiliate link.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Commissions will be paid on the<b> total sale amount from each order</b>.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Payouts will be made on a <b>monthly basis</b> via the designated payment method (after the 30 day review period for all returns/cancelations/refunds).</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;\">a) Commission Rate</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">There is a base commission rate is 30<b>%</b> per verified sale. </span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Additional incentives may be offered for top-performing affiliates: </span>