family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Commissions will not be paid on refunded or fraudulent orders. If a chargeback occurs, commissions will be reversed.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">3. Brand Guidelines</span></b></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">To ensure a consistent and positive brand image, affiliates must adhere to the following:</span></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Use only approved banners, logos, and creative materials provided by WithLove.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Refrain from altering or modifying WithLove branding elements.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Represent WithLove in a professional and positive manner.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">4. Compliance and Termination</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Affiliates must comply with all terms outlined herein.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Violations of these terms may result in:</span>\n<ul type=\"circle\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\">\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Suspension</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"> from the affiliate program</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Forfeiture</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"> of unpaid commissions</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:rgb(65,65,65);background:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">Permanent termination</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"> of your affiliate account</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">WithLove reserves the right to monitor affiliate activity and terminate partnerships at its sole discretion.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">5. Disclosure Requirements</span></b></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">Affiliates must clearly disclose their affiliate relationship with WithLove in all promotional materials, as required by the <b>FTC Guidelines</b>.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">6. Changes to the Program</span></b></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#414141;\">WithLove reserves the right to modify or terminate the affiliate program at any time. Affiliates will be notified of any significant changes.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background:#FFFFFF;margin:0in;font-size:12pt;font-family